    ;; ------------------------------------------------------------------
    ;; Renames, removals, times, links, copies (std/native/llrt fsops.xo's
    ;; layer 0); WASI preview1 has no permission bits and no locks, so
    ;; perm, chmod, and lock report NOMODE (0x10000, rt4.xo's own code) as
    ;; an Io error that says so, after a stat's error if any. Node's WASI
    ;; sets times in whole seconds, and WASI timestamps are unsigned: no
    ;; time before 1970 (golden fs_ops_edges)

    ;; the status of WASI result e for the path x (0: success)
